        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಕಸರತ್ತು",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕಸರತ್ತು — kasarattu — \"a workout; physical exercise\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪ್ರತಿದಿನ ಬೆಳಗ್ಗೆ ಅಪ್ಪ ಅರ್ಧ ಗಂಟೆ ಕಸರತ್ತು ಮಾಡುತ್ತಾರೆ. pratidina beḷagge appa ardha gaṇṭe kasarattu māḍuttāre. Every morning father works out for half an hour."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also a clever trick or stunt."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕಸರತ್ತು (kasarattu) is usually traced to Persian kasrat, \"exercise\", which reached Kannada through Hindustani."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
